#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:330
msgid "The footer shows as many keys as fit the width of the terminal."
msgstr "El peu mostra tantes tecles com càpiguen a l'amplada del terminal."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:332
msgid "When something looks unexpected"
msgstr "Quan alguna cosa sembla inesperada"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:334
msgid ""
"**Assumed, please confirm** on a declaration calculated without saved "
"input history: Cadrumo cannot tell which values you typed. Open the box "
"and press Enter to confirm it; otherwise the next apply or calculation "
"returns it to its source."
msgstr ""
"**Suposada, confirma-la** en una declaració calculada sense historial de "
"dades introduïdes: Cadrumo no pot saber quins valors vas escriure. Obre "
"la casella i prem Enter per confirmar-la; altrament, la propera aplicació"
" o càlcul la retorna a la font."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:337
msgid ""
"**Reference value.** The official form fixes the box; you cannot change "
"it."
msgstr ""
"**Valor de referència.** El model oficial fixa la casella; no la pots "
"canviar."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:338
msgid ""
"**Pages arranged automatically.** Cadrumo arranged the pages from the "
"official design and nobody has reviewed them by hand. Every box still "
"appears exactly once."
msgstr ""
"**Pàgines ordenades automàticament.** Cadrumo ha ordenat les pàgines a "
"partir del disseny oficial i ningú no les ha revisat a mà. Cada casella "
"continua apareixent exactament una vegada."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:341
msgid ""
"A modelo with no arrangement opens with every box in box number order, "
"for viewing only."
msgstr ""
"Un Modelo sense disposició s'obre amb totes les caselles en ordre de "
"número de casella, només per veure-les."
